Z||000000||Robert||07-06-2000||10:23 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/packed.jpg"> <P><BR>10 hours till I hit the road on the longest trip “Thunder” and I have ever taken.  I’ve been CARbo-loading today, to prepare myself for the ordeal.  We are on our way to West Fest 2000 in San Diego, some 500 miles from home.  This should be interesting; we are hooking up with 4 or 5 other members of the Golden Gate Fiero’s at 4 am for a Fiero convoy.  I’ll try to get some interesting shots of my first “BIG Fiero” event.  Now if I can just get to sleep…….  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://canterburytrails.com/photo/fierosig.GIF">  <BR>87GT - "Thunder"||||reg||10
